============================================================
112. RESOURCE WARNING
=====================

Before loading model show:

expected RAM/VRAM fit
context
parallelism

============================================================
113. BENCHMARK UI
=================

Never hide hardware context.

Show:

model
digest
runtime
host
score dimensions

============================================================
114. PROJECT MODEL SETTINGS
===========================

Project settings:

coding model
review model
embedding model
cost policy

Default:

AUTO + ZERO COST

for no-cost profile.

============================================================
115. WORKFLOW INTEGRATION
=========================

Existing workflows use model requirement, not hardcoded provider.

Example:

requires:
coding: true
tools: true

router resolves suitable local model.

============================================================
116. AGENT PROFILE INTEGRATION
==============================

Agent profile specifies capability requirements.

No agent may bypass organization paid-provider policy.

============================================================
117. MCP + MODEL CAPABILITY
===========================

If workflow requires MCP/tools:

route only to model/runtime strategy capable of tool execution.

If no tool-capable model:

return clear limitation.

============================================================
118. STRUCTURED OUTPUT FALLBACK
===============================

A runtime may use server-side grammar/schema capability where available.

Do not treat post-hoc JSON repair as equivalent capability.

============================================================
119. BENCHMARK-DRIVEN AUTO ROUTING
==================================

Use historical benchmark only when:

same model digest
compatible hardware
compatible runtime
same benchmark version

============================================================
120. ROUTING CONFIDENCE
=======================

Return:

HIGH
MEDIUM
LOW

based on evidence.

Example:

actual benchmark on this host
→ HIGH

catalog only
→ LOW

============================================================
121. ROUTING REASON
===================

Persist routing explanation for job.

Do not expose hidden model reasoning.

============================================================
122. NO-COST AUDIT
==================

For every autonomous local job record:

paid_transport_calls
remote_model_calls
hosted_embedding_calls

Zero-cost profile success requires all prohibited counters = 0.

============================================================
123. NETWORK INTERCEPTION TEST
==============================

Strict offline E2E should fail on attempted external connection.

Do not merely inspect configuration after run.

============================================================
124. LOCAL MODEL SECURITY
=========================

Audit:

model URL SSRF
server binding
model file permissions
download paths
archive traversal
digest mismatch
unsafe executable download
MCP interaction

============================================================
125. MODEL FILE IS DATA, RUNTIME IS CODE
========================================

Do not execute arbitrary scripts from model repositories merely to load
weights.

Avoid trust_remote_code-like behavior unless explicit high-risk policy
permits it.

============================================================
126. DOWNLOAD FORMAT ALLOWLIST
==============================

No-cost GGUF path should download only intended model artifacts and
metadata.

Do not pull arbitrary executables.

============================================================
127. HUGGING FACE CACHE
=======================

Where Hugging Face tooling is used, respect its cache semantics rather
than copying files unnecessarily.

Support explicit local cache path.

============================================================
128. DISK CLEANUP SECURITY
==========================

Deletion stays inside managed model cache.

Path traversal test mandatory.

============================================================
129. RELEASE TEST PROFILES
==========================

CORE_FREE
SELF_HOSTED
LOCAL_RUNTIME_VERIFIED
LOCAL_CODING_VERIFIED
SAAS

Do not collapse them.

============================================================
130. CORE_FREE
==============

Requires:

offline core
zero paid calls
model provider contracts
FakeLocalModel pipeline
local storage
