============================================================
141. DEFINITION OF DONE
=======================

Upgrade-15 is complete only when:

[ ] catalog models cannot appear installed accidentally
[ ] local model lifecycle is explicit
[ ] llama.cpp is first-class
[ ] Ollama remains first-class
[ ] vLLM remains optional
[ ] generic local server remains supported
[ ] model source abstraction exists
[ ] acquisition is explicit
[ ] downloads are revision/digest attributable
[ ] gated-model requirements are respected
[ ] license metadata is visible
[ ] no automatic giant model download occurs
[ ] cache management is safe
[ ] CPU-only host is fully supported
[ ] model fit includes context/overhead
[ ] safety memory margin exists
[ ] quantization profiles exist
[ ] runtime auto-tuning exists
[ ] tuning is hardware/model/runtime-version specific
[ ] benchmark tournament exists
[ ] rankings are multi-dimensional
[ ] project model profiles exist
[ ] model=auto is explainable
[ ] paid fallback remains disabled in zero-cost mode
[ ] air-gapped model import works
[ ] offline execution permits zero external calls
[ ] real runtime evidence is clearly separated from simulations
[ ] model quality failure cannot be hidden
[ ] inherited tenant/security gates stay green

