## 30. Final Verdict

Never say:

LOCAL AI FULLY VERIFIED

if no actual model produced tokens.

Never say:

MODEL INSTALLED

for a static catalog entry.

Never say:

BEST MODEL

unless comparison was performed on compatible measured evidence.

Never say:

ZERO COST

if a hidden paid fallback remains possible.

The required product behavior is:

ZCoder understands this machine,
knows which local models really exist,
knows which ones actually fit,
measures them,
selects an appropriate one,
and can execute without silently spending money.
